{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXCAVATE A WONDER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An elite team of archeological excavators (And you) have landed on the mysterious Mezokorane, a ruin grasped between the edges of reality. While they rebuild a decrepid museum, you're left to wander. What secrets does this city harbour?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502120/extras/e27fbac61aade1a396ab52de2d945b9b.poster.avif?t=1772557095\" aria-label=\"A pentapedal character traverses through a blossoming, yet cluttered museum.\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502120/extras/e27fbac61aade1a396ab52de2d945b9b.webm?t=1772557095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502120/extras/e27fbac61aade1a396ab52de2d945b9b.mp4?t=1772557095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GUARDED BY PUZZLES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new paths by solving hand-crafted conundrums that build upon each other. Learn through incremental experimentation and delve into the furthest reaches of this ravaged metropolis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502120/extras/74e3d332e7ee56ed0cf5336a2ee64302.poster.avif?t=1772557095\" aria-label=\"A pentapedal character manipulates a cloudy set of blocks on the surface of a marshy lake.\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502120/extras/74e3d332e7ee56ed0cf5336a2ee64302.webm?t=1772557095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502120/extras/74e3d332e7ee56ed0cf5336a2ee64302.mp4?t=1772557095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHROUDED IN MYSTERY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect their stories, study their past and understand their tools. This world may be foreign to you, but they left instructions and you've got a pretty good translator app on your tablet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502120/extras/46e3c6cb583418b4b92a40785da1d042.poster.avif?t=1772557095\" aria-label=\"A pentapedal character twists and rotates a tumbler lock that appears in disrepair, under the heat of an oasis.\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502120/extras/46e3c6cb583418b4b92a40785da1d042.webm?t=1772557095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502120/extras/46e3c6cb583418b4b92a40785da1d042.mp4?t=1772557095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is being soley developed with regular human intelligence and nothing artificial. Art comes from the value of human experience; that which cannot be digitally pantomined.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2502120?t=1772557095","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502120/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772557095","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502120/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772557095","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502120/